# TAPD Field Reference

The field schema below is what the **MCP tools accept as `data`**. TAPD's
underlying schema may differ — when in doubt, call the corresponding `_list`
tool with `limit=1` to see real values from the user's workspace. Status
enums in particular vary per project; **always call `tapd_workflows_list`**
when changing a status to confirm the literal value.

> Workspace IDs are required on almost every call. Read `~/.tapd/cache.json`
> for the user's accessible workspaces (loaded via `tapd-overview`).

## Story (需求)

| field | required | type | notes |
|---|---|---|---|
| `workspace_id` | ✓ | string | from `cache.json` |
| `name` | ✓ | string | 标题 |
| `description` |   | string (HTML) | 描述，支持富文本 |
| `status` |   | enum | per-workspace via `tapd_workflows_list`; common: `planning`, `developing`, `testing`, `resolved` |
| `current_owner` |   | string | TAPD username (NOT id). Multiple users joined by `;` |
| `iteration_id` |   | string | 迭代 id |
| `effort` |   | number | 预估工时（小时） |
| `remain` |   | number | 剩余工时（小时） |
| `progress` |   | number | 0–100 |
| `priority` |   | enum | `1`–`4` (1=最高) |

## Bug (缺陷)

| field | required | type | notes |
|---|---|---|---|
| `workspace_id` | ✓ | string |  |
| `title` | ✓ | string |  |
| `description` |   | HTML | 描述，可含复现步骤 |
| `status` |   | enum | typical: `new`, `in_progress`, `resolved`, `closed`. **Normal users MUST NOT set `closed`** — see `tapd-safety-rules` HARD-RULE-2 |
| `severity` |   | enum | `fatal` / `serious` / `normal` / `prompt` / `advice` |
| `priority` |   | enum | `urgent` / `high` / `medium` / `low` |
| `reporter` |   | string | 通常自动填 |
| `current_owner` |   | string | 处理人，TAPD username |
| `iteration_id` |   | string |  |
| `module` |   | string | 模块名 |
| `resolution` |   | enum | `fixed` / `wontfix` / `duplicated` / etc. — set when status=resolved |

## Task (任务)

> ⚠️ **Normal users MUST NOT call `tapd_tasks_create`** (HARD-RULE-3). Update
> their own assigned tasks is fine.

| field | required | type | notes |
|---|---|---|---|
| `workspace_id` | ✓ | string |  |
| `name` | ✓ | string |  |
| `status` |   | enum | `open`, `progressing`, `done` (project-dependent) |
| `owner` |   | string | TAPD username |
| `effort` |   | number | hours |
| `progress` |   | number | 0–100 |
| `story_id` / `bug_id` |   | string | parent entity if any |

## Timesheet (工时)

| field | required | type | notes |
|---|---|---|---|
| `workspace_id` | ✓ | string |  |
| `owner` | ✓ | string | default `$ME` from cache |
| `timespent` | ✓ | number | **hours** (e.g. `2.5`) |
| `spentdate` | ✓ | string | `YYYY-MM-DD` |
| `story_id` / `bug_id` / `task_id` | ✓ (one of) | string | the entity worked on |
| `memo` |   | string | 备注 |

## Comment (评论)

| field | required | type | notes |
|---|---|---|---|
| `workspace_id` | ✓ | string |  |
| `entry_type` | ✓ | enum | `stories` / `bugs` / `tasks` |
